• Exfiltration: The unauthorized unauthorized transfer of data from a computer or network system.
• Exfoliation: A mechanical weathering process where outer rock layers peel away due to repeated expansion and contraction from temperature shifts.
• Exothermic Reaction: A chemical reaction that releases thermal energy into its surrounding environment, causing a measurable rise in temperature.
• Expert System: An artificial intelligence software application that mimics the decision-making ability of a human expert within a specific domain.
